{"unit_id":"tag:042U:proof","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。令<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>的fppf覆盖（fppf covering）。令<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>的基变换（base change）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n若<MATH_0006>为浸入（immersion），则每个<MATH_0007>都是浸入（immersion），见《代数空间（Spaces）》引理<REF_0001>。这证明了定义<REF_0002>中的正向蕴含。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n反之，假设每个<MATH_0008>都是浸入（immersion）。由《代数空间上的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>，这蕴含每个<MATH_0009>都是分离的（separated）。由《代数空间上的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0004>，这蕴含每个<MATH_0010>都是局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite）。因此，可见<MATH_0011>是局部拟有限的（locally quasi-finite）且分离的（separated），这是应用引理<REF_0005>和<REF_0006>得到的。由《代数空间上的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0007>，这蕴含<MATH_0012>是可表的（representable）！\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n由《代数空间上的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0008>，只需证明，对每个概形（scheme）<MATH_0013>和态射（morphism）<MATH_0014>，基变换（base change）<MATH_0015>都是浸入（immersion）。由《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0009>，可找到由概形（schemes）构成的fppf覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0016>，它加细覆盖（covering）<MATH_0017>到<MATH_0018>的拉回（pullback）。因此可见，<MATH_0019>（根据上一段的结果，它是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism））在拉回到<MATH_0020>的一个fppf（由概形（schemes）构成）的各成员后成为浸入（immersion）。于是，由概形（schemes）的相应结果，<MATH_0021>是浸入（immersion），见《下降（Descent）》引理<REF_0010>。\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"Spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"代数空间上的态射"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"代数空间上的态射"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"代数空间上的态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"代数空间上的态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"代数空间上的拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"态射及概形态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖","context":"下降覆盖；待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"拉回态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入","context":"待下降性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"Spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"代数空间上的态射","context":"引用章名中的术语；待决。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限的","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表的","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"测试对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"代数空间上的拓扑","context":"引用章名中的术语；待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"覆盖成员及概形结果；待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"加细的覆盖；待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"覆盖的拉回；待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","targe